COMPILATION OF: E46N16

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N16

   1 a 0000 E46N16:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] RUNTIME CONTROL: E46N11 with the SKIP
   4 a 0006      STATEMENT REMOVED and nothing else changed.  [C295]
   5 a 0006      and [C299] predict its payload exactly: each item is
   6 a 0006      apostrophe-quoted, items take one blank between them
   7 a 0006      across statement boundaries, and a PUT never
   8 a 0006      terminates its line -- so `'A' 'B'` is 7 bytes. */
   9 c 0006   dcl outf file;
  10 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('N16OUT DAT');
  11 c 0023   put file(outf) list('A');
  12 c 003D   put file(outf) list('B');
  13 c 0057   close file(outf);
  14 c 005D   stop;
  15 a 0060 end E46N16;

CODE SIZE = 0060
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3884
END  COMPILATION
